<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">PHUNGHOTU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ecclesiastes</para>
  <para style="toc2">PHUNGHOTU</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pht</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHUNGHOTU</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ecclesiastes</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">Phunghotu ccauh kyahin, byakhu tuatu mihawpaw a tuanaw te a muihnaw kha a um. Tuh-e paw nynh ccungccaw hiinnaw tuh dyn zah arawsekuhpaw tuanaw te phe beih zah ngaeangthua lan umpaw dingleinaw te accakaepaw athuanaw kong kha hoyte tua zah, “ccungccaw hiinnaw hynh accakaepaw nynh thua,” a ci. Ccungccaw hiinnaw athangnaw a uktupaw Pachia paccynnaw kha aning nynh nyh kho khyh. Tuhzemah, tuhcite a la thua zemah, aning nynh ccungccaw hae kha ryalaw zuaku lan te Pachia lasung kha lungtuakhaeku khonaw ciate lungtuakhaeku lan tuanaw a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">Byakhu tuatu mihaw hae patae tuh alunghua lan hoyleinaw langsang te leih do hae zah lungro lan kou um. Thuasalama Baebu lungkhu kya hynh-e ccauh a umnawpaw hynh Baebu lungkhu e zynnaw tuh tuhcihawpaw hoyleinaw langsang te muihnaw te lunghiinnaw kha akote tua kho nawlan nynh thua. Ccungccaw patae nynh Phunghotu ccauh muinsado kyahin mimaw te mimaw kha dokuh hae zah lungtangnaw a mue hae, e tuanaw-roihnaw azeikunaw Baebu kyahin asung-epaw hiinnaw a pya khotu Pachia kya ngaehoinaw a um cipaw a ny hae.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Hiinnaw hynh eenaw a hoi tou? 1.1—2.26</para>
  <para style="io1">Hiinnaw kong byaphung hae 3.1—11.8</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyathya tuanaw pyanaw 11.9—12.8</para>
  <para style="io1">Thangsahnaw 12.9-14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hiinnaw hynh Accakaepaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem a umpaw siapharan, David ccapaw phunghotu bya:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Accakaepaw, accakaepaw!</para>
  <para style="q2">Atyn-are hynh accakaepaw nynh thua cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Phunghotu nynh a ho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh khuaninso kaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">thawte rya a lawpaw balyn hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">paw thanenaw mou a mue?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />She kheit thang zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">she kheit yn thua, thuasalama</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi tuh zungzae atyn.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuanin tuh yn thua zah a ccah,</para>
  <para style="q2">te yn thuanaw hmin langkhe palou a ki.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khisan tuh alia langkhe zawbung zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">palung langkhe bua azawthung;</para>
  <para style="q1">zaw bungthung zah bua a ki.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rili lungkhu lang a lua hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama rili tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">abeih cite umlae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaw hae tuh oun luanaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">tuinaw langkhe kithui hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kyate bua a lua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atyn-are hynh lungriathae</para>
  <para style="q2">lanpaw cci nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">hotae lanpaw thua khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">mit nynh muih zah dokhin khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nakaring nynh thae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">azaw ci um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A la um vae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn um ung cih paw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">cyi kou vae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">cyi lan ungpaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">khuanin kaw kya athawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">paw sanmah um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Dotua, e hynh athawpaw nynh thua,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite ho lanpaw uccaw a um tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e tuh aening mawze langmawlya</para>
  <para style="q2">phe a la um vae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Langmawlya e ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ning athua vae hae, oun um cih paw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae kha mah tuh-e hae koute</para>
  <para style="q2">oun um hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nyh vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hawnaw Ccung Thane Leinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Phunghotu kae nynh Jerusalem kya Israel siapharan lang he ka tang tuh, <verse number="13" style="v" />vaawlui zakaw kya cyi a la thuapaw balyn kha hawnaw te ccung lan zah akaw-aleih ny lan cite ka tuaku; Pachia nynh ccungccaw hanlan yn la pyapaw ryakunaw hynh lungtuakhaeku lanpaw thua khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuanin kaw kya cyipaw cyisahnaw balyn kha ka muih; abalyn mawte accakaepaw thua zah, khisan nulang deekupaw nynh thua cipaw ka ny.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Akoupaw kha lawbabin lan</para>
  <para style="q2">rae kho thua khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a um leipaw kha ria kho thua khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kamaw te kamaw kha, “Kae tuh kae ka mawze Jerusalem a la ukpaw balyn laeze myaryamaw ka hawhua; ka thinlung nynh hawnaw te nynaw kha ccaerarih lan a ny,” ka ciku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:29-31">1Si 4.29-31</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Te ka thinlung tuh hawnaw kha thuasah, lungkyh leinaw te ngaeenaw kha thuasah nythya nawlan ka mang. E hynh mah khisan nulang deekupaw nynh athua cipaw ka ny.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize hawnaw alung ze</para>
  <para style="q2">lungriathaenaw houh alung,</para>
  <para style="q1">nynaw alungpaw ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyanaw alung.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hoysahnaw hynh Accakaepaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kamaw te kamaw kha, “Rangtua, hoysahnaw kha ka cyibua tua cih; namaw te namaw kha na lungtuasaku tua,” ka ciku. Thuasalama hynh-e hynh mah accakaepaw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nuinpaw hynh ngaeenaw nynh thua. Hoysahnaw hynh pawmou a ccungkia? <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh vaawlui zakaw kya sosoh a hiin lyahin, ccungccaw hanlan ahoypaw cyi lanpaw kha ka muih kho mawlaezung, ka thinlung nynh hawnaw a ry keiccuze, ka pyn kha misutui te pawtemou lungtuasah lan cipaw te ngaeenaw kya pawtemou ciaku lan cipaw kha ka ccungku. <verse number="4" style="v" />Myarya lepaw ryalaw kha ka law; inn hae kha ka sakkuh zah misu khokhu hae kha ka raeku;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:23-27">1Si 10.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:22-27">2Sh 9.22-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Haetapaw khokhu te thingku ccounaw khokhu hae kha ka raekuh zah, tuin kyakhe thingthae ku aphuinphuin kha ka ccouku. <verse number="6" style="v" />Alethungpaw thingku hae aponaw loram kha tui bu nawlan cite tuili hae kha ka raeku. <verse number="7" style="v" />Seenung te seepaw hae kha ka rekuh hae zah, ka inn kya a puipaw see hae kha mah ka hoi hae; kae ka mawze Jerusalem a la umpaw lukhakheit nynh a hoipaw laeze alung lante, vaetua phu hae te tuuphu hae kha mah patae ka hoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:23">1Si 4.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Siapharan hae te ka ukpaw ram hae kya-e sui te ngun te sisua hae kha ka sueluaku hae; hlawsahthya hae paw nopi pise ka hoi hae, ccungccaw nynh rythyapaw zu patae ka hoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:10">1Si 10.10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 10:14-22">14-22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhcite kae ka mawze Jerusalem a la umpaw balyn laeze, a hoirum huapaw lang ka tang; ka hawnaw mah ka kya atyn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:25">1Sh 29.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mit nynh a rypaw miakaw kha ka mue; ka thinlung nynh a rypaw hoysahnaw miakaw kha ka sungkuh khyh, reihkute rya ka lawpaw balyn kya thinlung hoysahnaw ka mue zah, tuh-e tuh reihkute rya ka law mee lasung nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh ka kuih nynh a la cyipaw te reihkute rya ka la lawpaw balyn kha ka tuatua zah, abalyn mawte accakaepaw te khisan nulang deekupaw nynh thua, vaawlui zakaw kya mue lanpaw pawpaw mah um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh hawnaw, lungkyh leinaw te ngaeenaw kha ka tuathui; siapharan nynh amaw maw e siapharan laeze pawmou a cyi kho? Amaw maw e siapharan nynh a la cyi vae paw rou kha nynh a cyi kho. <verse number="13" style="v" />Awnaw tuh mohnaw laeze ahoyhua hawte, hawnaw tuh ngaeenaw laeze ahoyhua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hawpaw tuh a lu kya mit a hoi,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama a ngaeepaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mohnaw kya a cceih.</para>
  <para style="p">Tuhzemah mih lu ning mawte phe lokuhpaw kha a tung kalang hae cipaw ka ny. <verse number="15" style="v" />“A ngaeepaw tungvaw acyihkuhpaw kha kae ka tungvaw mah yn cyihkuh cih; tukeiccuze myarya ka hawpaw hynh pawmou athane?” cite kamaw te kamaw ka ciku. Te hynh-e hynh mah accakaepaw nynh thua, ka ciku. <verse number="16" style="v" />A hawpaw kha thuasah, a ngaeepaw kha thuasah zungzae syntaw kho thua khyh, malang ccyh kya tuh abalyn mawte ning athua cih. A ngaeepaw hawte a hawpaw mah a chih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hiinnaw hynh ka hua, pawccecize vaawlui zakaw kya cyipaw miakaw hynh kae ka hanlan ngaethya lan umpaw nynh thua, abalyn mawte accakaepaw thua zah khisan nulang deekupaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuanin kaw kya reihkute rya ka la lawpaw balyn hynh ka hua, e hae hynh ka nukhu e ccungccaw hanlan ka cciatawsya hahe cih, <verse number="19" style="v" />tuh-e ccungccaw tuh a haw lanpaw te a ngaee lanpaw kha hummou a nyh? Pawpawte athua zemah khuanin kaw kya reihkute rya ka lawpaw te ka hawnaw ka mangpaw balyn tungvaw kya aning tuh bawi a la thua cih. E hynh zemah accakaepaw nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khuanin kaw kya reihkute rya ka la lawpaw balyn te asekuh lante ngaehoinaw um leite ka lungthawthang, <verse number="21" style="v" />pawccecize vaekhakheit tuh hawnaw, nynaw te thyanaw khate reihkute rya a lahtupaw nynh, tuh-e hanlan reihkute rya a lah leipaw mingccangpaw kha abalyn mawte a cciatawpah hahe cih. E hynh zemah accakaepaw te myarya hoyleinaw nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh khuanin kaw kya reihkute rya a lawpaw te a thawthuapaw balyn kyate pawmou a mue? <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize tuh-e ccungccapaw a ccyh balyn tuh ngaethyanaw te phe beih zah, a ryalaw tuh lungriathaenaw nynh thua; khuazi ccyh heize a lungdae khyh. E hynh mah accakaepaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:7">Job 5.7</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 14:1">14.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccungccaw hanlan tuh ae te nia, te reihkute ryalawpaw kya lungpawnaw muepaw laeze ahoy huapaw um vae khyh. E hynh zemah Pachia kuih kyate nynh yn thua cipaw ka ny;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:13">Pht 3.13</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 5:18">5.18</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 9:7">9.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:19">Luk 12.19</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:32">1Ko 15.32</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />pawccecize Pachia kyate holeite hummou ae kho zah, hummou a lungtua kho? <verse number="26" style="v" />Pachia lungry a tungpaw kha Pachia nynh hawnaw, nynaw te lungpawnaw a pya; thuasalama misei kha tuh ccakhungpaw te pumpaw ryalaw kha a lawsah hae; tuh-e tuh Pachia lungry a tungtupaw kyalya pya lanpaw nynh thua. E hynh zemah accakaepaw thua zah, khisan nulang deekupaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:8">Job 32.8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:6">Ptb 2.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Atyn-are nynh Ccyh A Hoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atyn-are hanlan kumvaelori a um, vaawlui zakaw e uccaw miakaw hanlan accyh a um:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />pui ccyh um zah chi ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">ccou ccyh um zah ccoupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khaee ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chia ccyh um zah dansah ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">phou ccyh um zah sak ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />raw ccyh um zah nuin ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethya ccyh um zah law ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />lung hae kha ccaring vua ccyh um zah</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan suelua ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">pomku ccyh um zah</para>
  <para style="q2">pomku khyh ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ccung ccyh um zah zosah ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">ccy ccyh um zah vua ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />seii ccyh um zah, hui ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">zya dae ccyh um zah byaho ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />sungsaku ccyh um zah huaku ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtukku ccyh um zah adae ccyh a um;</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh Nawpaw Rya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ryalahtu hae nynh thawte reihkute rya a law hae paw kyate pawmou a mue hae? <verse number="10" style="v" />Pachia nynh ccungccaw miakaw oun pyapaw ryakunaw kha ka ny vae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pachia nynh atyn-are kha amaw ccyh te angaekuh lante a rae vae; tuhpiaze nulang ccyh te malang ccyh a um cipaw kha ccungccaw thinlung kya a nysah; tuhzemah Pachia nynh atakaw te athangnaw cia pawtemou a rae cipaw kha ccungccaw nynh nyh kho khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh a hiin lungkhu kya, lungtua lungpawte a um lanpaw laeze amaw hanlan ahoy huapaw pawpaw mah um vae khyh; <verse number="13" style="v" />tuhpiaze ccungccaw miakaw nynh a ae lanpaw, a nia lanpaw te reihkute rya a lawpaw miakaw kya a lungtuakhaeku lanpaw hynh Pachia lasung nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pachia nynh a cyipaw miakaw tuh zungzae atyn cipaw ka ny; biachih khopaw pawpaw mah um khyh zah lawbang khopaw pawpaw mah um khyh; ccungccaw hae nynh amaw malang rawrinaw a hoi ccaw hae cite, Pachia nynh tuhcite a cyi. <verse number="15" style="v" />Atu a umpaw hynh a la um vae paw nynh thua; malang yn um cih paw mah a la um vae paw nynh thua; Pachia nynh a la um vae paw kha bua a umsah thui.</para>
  <para style="s1">Laephi vawlan Dingleinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhpiaze khuanin kaw kyahin byading a umnaw kya hoyleinaw a um, dingnaw a umnaw kya hoyleinaw mah a um cipaw ka ny. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pachia nynh miding te mihoy leipaw kha bya a pia cih hae, pawccecize uccaw miakaw hanlan te ryalaw miakaw hanlan accyh a khya vae, cite ka thinlung kya ka tuaku. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ccungccaw hynh sarangpaw hawte nynh athua cipaw langsaku khylan Pachia nynh ccungccaw kha a syntawtua, cite ka thinlung kya ka tuaku. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize sarangpaw te ccungccaw hynh athangnaw tuh phe lokuh; sarangpaw a chi hawte ccungccaw mah a chihbua. Parouh te alokuhpaw hy a hoi hae, ccungccaw hynh sarangpaw laeze thanehuanaw hoi khyh; pawccecize abalyn mawte accakaepaw nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Abalyn mawte hmin san kheit kalan nynh a ccia hae; abalyn mawte laenoi kyate oun thua hae zah, laenoi kalan bua a ki hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccaw muisaw tuh palung lang kaethung zah, sarangpaw muisaw tuh alia lang laephi kalan a cceihbung cipaw hummou a nyh? <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hanlan tuh a ryalaw kya a lungtua lanpaw laeze ahoy huapaw pawpaw mah um vae khyh cipaw ka ny. Tuh-e tuh amaw hanpaw nynh thua; amaw nukhute pawmou a um cih cipaw ny khylan hum nynh mou a hopah kho cih?</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te khuanin kaw kya cyi athuapaw tuaasahkunaw balyn kha bua ka muih. Tuaasahkunaw a ing hae paw mitphi khuh dotua, minmin kha lungtangnaw a pyatu lu kheit san um khyh! A tuaasahtu hae kuih kya tuh huhan a um, tuaasahkunaw a ing hae paw kha lungtangnaw a pyatu lu kheit san um khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te a chih vae paw michi tuh a hiin ungpaw mihiin laeze a lungtua huapaw nynh thua cite ka tua; <verse number="3" style="v" />thuasalama minmin parouh laeze a um boi loh leipaw, khuanin kaw kya ahoy leipaw cyisahnaw a muih boi leipaw tuh ahoyhua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Oute reihkute ryalawnaw balyn te ryalawthyanaw balyn hynh lu kheit te lu kheit eiungnaw kyate nynh yn thua cipaw ka ny. E hynh zemah accakaepaw thua zah, khisan nulang deekupaw nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mingaee nynh tuh a kuih pomkuh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw ngesaw kha a roku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungdaete kuihphe kheit hoi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">reihkute ryalawkuh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">khisan nulang deekute</para>
  <para style="q2">kuihphe ning hoi laeze ahoyhua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukoute khuanin kaw kya accakaepaw bua ka muihpaw tuh: <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccungccaw lu kheit tuh a makhaete um zah, ccapaw te uno mah hoi khyh; tuhzemah reihkute rya a lawpaw kha thang khyh zah, a mit tuh a hoirumnaw khate papinmaw a lungryachikhaekuh khyh. “Hum hanlan mou reihkute rya ka lah zah, hoysahnaw hoi leite ka um?” cipaw tuakuh khyh. E hynh mah accakaepaw thua zah lungtuakhaeku leipaw ryakunaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ruiban Hoi tuh Ahoy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lu kheit laeze lu ning ahoyhua, pawccecize reihkute ryalaw mee alunghua a mue hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh a khuliaku ze, ccangpaw lu kheit nynh a tho cih; thuasalama lu kheit makhaete tuh a khuliaku ze ngaethya kou a um, a bawmtu hoi vae khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Lu ning te pynkheihlan a i hae ze mih khualung; thuasalama lu kheit makhaete tuh pawtemou a khualung kho cih? <verse number="12" style="v" />Lu kheit nynh ccangpaw lu kheit kha a tae kho zemah, lu ning nynh tuh lu kheit kha a tae cih. Ccangthum te ruepaw liarue tuh zoikadeihte pae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuanaw pyakupaw a lawkuh leipaw siapharan ataw vae paw laeze a hawpaw mino a ryachipaw tuh ahoyhua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thonginn kyate yn poupaw ccungccaw mah thuasah, tuhkhyhze peenaw kya ryachi te a la puipaw nynh heize mah thuasah siapharan lang a tang kho. <verse number="15" style="v" />Khuanin kaw kya a umpaw ahysuepaw balyn nynh siapharan lang a tangrupaw khah-e minopaw kha a zui hae cipaw ka ny; <verse number="16" style="v" />aning nynh a cciakhae hae paw ccungccaw balyn tuh riatae um khyh. Tuhzemah nyalang oun um hae paw nynh tuh a tungvaw mih lungtua lan khyh. Thanccingte hynh-e hynh mah accakaepaw thua zah khisan nulang deekupaw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sawtuanaw, Zakawsangsakunaw te Lungryachinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pachia inn lang na ccia vae ze, na laanccia kha la raeringkuh; mingaee hae nynh silawnaw raepaw laeze bya ngaeku khylan naekute ccia tuh ahoyhua; pawccecize mingaee hae nynh ahoy leipaw rae kha pawtemou sibia lan cipaw nyh khyh hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Byaho lan rangsakuh nan; Pachia malang byaho lan na thinlung te rangsakuh nan, pawccecize Pachia tuh vaawram um zah, nang tuh lae vawlan nynh na um; tukeiccuze na bya zya sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungriathaenaw alung ze maan alung, te a ngaeepaw tuh bya patae a ho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachia kalan byakinkunaw na rae ze, ccingsah lanpaw na thysung nan sah; pawccecize a ngaeepaw tungvaw lungtuanaw hoi khyh. Bya na kinkupaw kha ccingsah tua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 66:13-14">Sam 66.13-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Bya na kinkuh zah, ccingsah leite na umpaw laeze bya na kinku khyhpaw kha ahoyhua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Na bya nynh seinaw kalan ae cciakhae nan sah, “Ka cyiseipaw nynh thua,” cite locceihtu malang ho nan; pawccemou Pachia nynh na bya kha a thinria zah na cyipaw ryalaw kha ryakhae a ro lanpaw tuh?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maan patae sah te bya patae ho tuh accakaepaw nynh thua; Pachia raw kha la rih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ram ramkhakheit kya ryachi hae tungvaw tuaasahkunaw um zah, byading te ahmepaw a um khyhpaw kha na muih lanze na ngaeangthua nan sah; pawccecize ahangpaw bawi kha ccangpaw ahang huapaw bawi nynh a thungkhaw; te minmin laeze ahang huapaw bawi lu kheit a um ung. <verse number="9" style="v" />Laephi kyate a poupaw tuh ccungccaw balyn hanlan nynh thua; siapharan nynh mah loo kha a doliakuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phua a rypaw ccungccaw tuh phua te a lungryachikhaekuh lan khyh; sisua a rypaw tuh a muepaw khate a lungryachikhaekuh lan khyh. E hynh mah accakaepaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hoipaw uccaw alung ze, a aepaw ccungccaw mah alung; uccaw a hoitu tuh a uccaw kha a mit te a muih laelan, ccangpaw pawmou a mue?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ryalahpaw tuh beihtaraw a ae zemah, patae a ae zemah hoyte a ih; thuasalama mihoipaw tuh a sisua pataepi kha nynh amaw kha isah kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuanin kaw kya ngaethya lan umpaw hoyleinaw ka muihpaw tuh: a hoitu nynh amaw vawsaw nawlan a hoirumnaw kha a ccyku, <verse number="14" style="v" />tuh-e hoirumnaw tuh ahoy leipaw ryalaw keiccuze phe azo; aning nynh ccaaw a saah zemah, a ccaaw hae hanlan a kuih kya pawpaw mah um khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />A nung vue kyate a sasete yn pui hawte, a sasete bua a ki cih; thawte rya a la lawpaw hanlan a kuih te pawpaw mah ccyngkuh lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21">Job 1.21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 49:17">Sam 49.17</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:7">1Ti 6.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />E hynh mah myarya thahpaw hoyleinaw nynh thua: yn thua lya hawte a cceih cih; khivae hanlan thawte rya a law hae paw kyate pawmou a mue cih hae? <verse number="17" style="v" />A she lungkhu balyn mohnaw kyakhe looh ae zah, lungriathaenaw, ccinaw te thinrianaw te a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahoy cite ka muihpaw tuh: khuanin kaw kya Pachia nynh aening oun pyapaw hiinnaw ccyh syntaraw kyahin ae te nia, te ah ryalaw kyate muepaw kyakhe lungtuakhaeku hynh nynh thua; pawccecize tuh-e tuh aening hanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pachia nynh ccungccaw miakaw kha sisua te hoirumnaw a pya, ccungccaw tuh tuh-e hae kyakhe a lungtuakhaekuh zah amaw hanpaw kha ccoute a ryalaw kya lungtuanaw a mue—tuh-e tuh Pachia lasung nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pachia nynh a thinlung kya lungtuanaw a pya keiccuze nulang e a hiinnaw ccyh kha liathui vae lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khuanin kaw kya ka muihpaw hoyleinaw a um, tuh-e tuh ccungccaw tungvaw kya rikalae lan phang a um: <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh a rypaw balyn kha hobounaw a um khyh ccaw cite, Pachia nynh sisua, hoirumnaw te sawtuanaw kha a pya, tuhzemah khah-e uccaw hae kyakhe lungtuakhaekunaw kha Pachia nynh a pya khyh keiccuze mingccangpaw nynh a lungtuakhaekuh. Tuh-e tuh accakaepaw thua zah ngaethya lan umpaw hoyleinaw nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccapaw nynh ccaaw za kheit saahkute kum patae a hiin kho; thuasalama hiin hoynaw kya lungtuakhaeku leite, shawku kya uukunaw a um khyh lanze, tuh-e paw laeze chite yn puipaw imua tuh ahoyhua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize tuh-e imua tuh accakaepaw lang yn pui zah mohnaw kalan a cceih, a min tuh mohnaw khate bong athua; <verse number="5" style="v" />tuhpiaze tuh-e imua tuh khuanin kha muih boi khyh zah pawpaw mah nyh khyh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Masaty e ccungccapaw tuh kum thong ning a la hiin zemah hoynaw kha a lungtuakhaekuh khyh, atyn-are hynh san kheit kalan khaw a ccia hae?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh thawte rya a lawpaw balyn hynh khalang lungkhu lang bawku khylan a la thua zemah, ae rynaw thinlung tuh a hoi mamin. <verse number="8" style="v" />A hawpaw tuh a ngaeepaw laeze pawmou a thanehua? A hiin hae paw malang khe pawtemou um lan cipaw a nykuh hae paw ryachi hae tuh pawmou a thane hae? <verse number="9" style="v" />Mit te muihpaw thanenaw hynh rylenaw thinlung te vaevui laeze ahoyhua; e hynh zemah accakaepaw thua zah khisan nulang deekupaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A la umty vae paw pawpaw zemah minphuty vae paw nynh thua, ccungccaw hynh pawmou athua cipaw ny athua, te ccungccaw tuh amaw laeze athung huapaw te rawseku kho thua khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Bya patae ho ze accakaepaw houh alung, tuhte athua lanze ccungccaw hanlan pawmou athane? <verse number="12" style="v" />Mynlyh hawte azothyapaw, accakaepaw ccungccaw hiinnaw syntaraw hanlan pawmou ahoy cipaw hummou a nyh? Amaw a chih koute khuanin kaw kya pawmou yn cyihkuh cih cipaw hum nynh mou a hopah kho?</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minhoynaw tuh aphutepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zimuin laeze ahoyhua,</para>
  <para style="q2">chi nin tuh pui nin laeze ahoyhua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:1">Ptb 22.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Michi a umnaw inn lang ccia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">poituanaw inn lang ccia laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoyhua;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize chinaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw miakaw</para>
  <para style="q1">athangnaw thua zah, tuh-e tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahiinpaw ccungccaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinlung kya a nyku lanpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngaethyanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nuinpaw laeze ahoyhua,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize maesue ngaethyanaw liate</para>
  <para style="q2">thinlung kha a lung a tuasah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A haw hae paw thinlung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">michi a umnaw inn kya a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama a ngaee hae paw thinlung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hoysahnaw inn kyakhe nynh a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ngaeepaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hlaw a sahpaw kha ngae laeze</para>
  <para style="q1">a hawpaw nynh a penawpaw bya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngae tuh ahoyhua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize a ngaeepaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a nuinpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ang akaw e maee a u cciamangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hinpaw ku aroi te nynh aloku;</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh zemah accakaepaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thanccingte, tuaasahkunaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hawpaw kha a ngaeesah.</para>
  <para style="q2">pyaruh nynh thinlung kha a ro.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Uccaw athangnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">athonaw laeze ahoyhua;</para>
  <para style="q1">lungsaenaw thinlung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lysakunaw thinlung laeze ahoyhua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thinria zoi nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaeepaw thinlung kya nynh a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:19">Jam 1.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Pawccepei langmawlya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">atu laeze a la hoyhua?” cite ho nan.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize tuh-e na khiapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnaw kyate yn thuapaw thua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hawnaw tuh rho hawte hoy zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khuanin a muih hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">athanepaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize hawnaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a pyapaw khynnaw tuh phua nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a pyapaw khynnaw te nynh aloku;</para>
  <para style="q2">nynaw a hoipaw tuh hawnaw hoi zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hawnaw nynh hiinnaw kha a pya,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh nynaw athanenawpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pachia ryalaw kha hoyte tuatua;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh phe a kousah vae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou lawbabin lan a rae kho?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Acyikuthya ccyh lya lungtuate um lah, vawsaw ccyh kya hoyte tuatua; ccungccaw nynh a chih koute yn um cih paw kha pawpaw mah a ny khyh ccaw cite, Pachia nynh lungtuanaw kha umsah zah, vawsawnaw kha mah a umsah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hiinnaw Byakhupaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Accakaepaw ka hiinnaw kya atyn-are kha ka muih vae; miding nynh a dingnaw kyakhe chih zah, ccungccaw hoyleipaw tuh ahoy leipaw a raenaw kyakhe a hiinshe asae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eih ding kaesy nan lah, eih haw kaesy nan; pawccemou namaw te namaw ryakhae na roku lanpaw tuh? <verse number="17" style="v" />Eih hoy khyh kaesy nan lah, a ngaeepaw mah la thua nan; pawccemou na ccyh azaw maw ryakhae na chi lanpaw tuh? <verse number="18" style="v" />Uccaw ccangkheit kha phang kyngte ccangpaw ccangkheit kha zuasah leipaw tuh ahoypaw nynh thua; pawccecize Pachia raw a rihpaw nynh tuh tuh-e ccangning mawkhate a tae cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuapi kya um hae paw uktu lu haw laeze hawnaw nynh ahawpaw lu kheit kha thawzung a hoisah hua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thanccingte, seinaw papin hoi leite hoynaw kyalya raete adingpaw ccungccaw laephi vawlan lu kheit sanmah um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh a ho hae paw miakaw kha na peki nan sah, tuhkhyhze tuh na ryalahtu nynh thya ae lawpaw kha na thaesei cih; <verse number="22" style="v" />Namaw nynh mah mingccangpaw hae tungvaw avae patae thya na law hae paw kha na thinlung nynh a ny.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />E balyn hynh hawnaw te ka syntawtua vae; “A hawpaw lang ka tang cih,” cite ka la tuaku, thuasalama hawnaw tuh kae te asawkuh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Hawnaw hynh thaethya aru, myarya khu zah, hum nynh mou a muih kho? <verse number="25" style="v" />Hawnaw te uccaw hae konglang kha ny khylan, thaethya khylan te ccung khylan zuakute ka tua, te hoyleinaw te ngaeenaw kha thaethya khylan ka zuaku. <verse number="26" style="v" />Chinaw laeze akhah huapaw, kaang athuapaw nopi kha ka muih, a thinlung tuh kaang te miabu thua zah, a kuih tuh heenawpaw bawtary nynh thua; Pachia lungry a tungpaw tuh tuh-e nopi kyate a lue, thuasalama misei tuh tuh-e nopi nynh a kyng. <verse number="27" style="v" />Dotua, ka muihpaw tuh hynh-e hynh nynh thua cite Phunghotu nynh a ci, ka ccung zah ka muih loh leipaw kha muih khylan, ccangkheit koute ccangkheit ka tuatua, <verse number="28" style="v" />buabua ka ccung zahmah ka muih khyh. Ccungccaw thong kheit laku kya ahawpaw pise lu kheit ka muih, thuasalama tuh-e hae laku kya ahawpaw nopi lu kheit san ka muih khyh. <verse number="29" style="v" />E ccangkheit kyalya hynh ka muih: Pachia nynh ccungccaw hynh miding lante a la rae, thuasalama ccungccaw nynh paccynkunaw patae kha a hoi.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hummou ahawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hawte athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">Uccaw asuilan ccaesahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou a nyh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hawnaw nynh ccungccaw mitmae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">awsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maesue hoyleinaw kha a rulae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Athyaapaw byakinkunaw kha na rae vae keiccuze siapharan nynh kaw a pyapaw kha cyitua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Rih nan; siapharan a umnaw kyate cciatua, hankhakheit kha a lungry athua vae khyh ze, na nenung nan sah, pawccecize aning nynh a rypaw miakaw kha a cyi kho. <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan bya tuh huhan a hoi, “Pawmou na cyi?” cite hum nynh mou a hopah ngan cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />A kawpyapaw kha a zuipaw miakaw tuh vawsaw tung lan khyh, ahawpaw ccungccaw thinlung nynh tuh accyh te cyi zia kha a nyh cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw hae vawsawnaw tuh ccungccaw hae tungvaw kya myarya ri salamah, uccaw miakaw nynh amaw accyh te cyinaw zia bebe a hoi hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Accaccingte, ccungccaw nynh pawmou yn cyihkuh cih cipaw nyh khyh, pawccecize pawte yn cyiku lanpaw kha hum nynh mou a hopah kho? <verse number="8" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah hy kha khee khylan hy a ukpaw huhan kha hoi khyh zah, chi nin a ukpaw huhan kha mah hoi khyh; tuh-e rhawtukkunaw kyate pounaw kaw um khyh, hoyleinaw a raetupaw kha hoyleinaw nynh luesah khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuanin kaw cyi athuapaw balyn hynh ka tua zah, e hae balyn hynh ka muih: Lu kheit nynh mingccangpaw kha vawsawnaw pya khylan huhan a mangnua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Oute shaw kya a uu hae paw ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha ka muih; minmin tuh hmin thyaa kya leih a tee hae paw te a pou hae paw thua hae zah, tuhcite a cyinaw hae khua kya thehoynaw a ccou hae paw nynh thua hae. E hynh mah accakaepaw nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahoy leipaw cyisahnaw kya detahnaw palou a um khyh keiccuze ccungccaw thinlung tuh ahoy leipaw cyi lan paccynkunaw te phe abeih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Misei hae nynh hoyleinaw kha avae patae a rae hae zemah mih hiinshe asae; tuhzemah Pachia raw a rih hae paw tuh amaw malang rawrite a um hae keiccuze hoynaw a ccou cih hae cipaw ka ny, <verse number="13" style="v" />thuasalama ccungccaw hoy leipaw tuh Pachia malang rawrite a um khyh keiccuze hoynaw ccou lan khyh, mynlyh alopaw mih hiinshe tuh sae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Laephi vawlan acyihkuhpaw accakaepaw ccangkheit a um, ccungccaw hoylei hae paw nynh mih cyisahnaw thyhte a ing lan hae paw kha adingpaw ccungccaw hae nynh ing hae zah, adingpaw ccungccaw hae nynh mih cyisahnaw thyhte a ccou lan hae paw kha ccungccaw hoylei hae paw nynh a ccou hae. E hynh mah accakaepaw nynh thua ka ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lungtuanaw hynh ka nawccah, pawccecize khuanin kaw kya ccungccaw hanlan aete niate mawtemaw lungtuanaw laeze ahoy huapaw pawpaw mah um vae khyh; pawccecize Pachia nynh khuanin kaw kya ccungccaw a pyapaw hiinnaw ccyh kya thawte rya a law lungkhu hynh-e hynhte a hiinkhaekuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hawnaw ny khylan te laephi vawlan a law hae paw ryalaw hae kha muih khylan he ka tua tuh, khuazi khuadae i leite ka um, <verse number="17" style="v" />tetuh khuanin kaw kya acyihkuhpaw, lu kheit nynh sanmah muih kho leipaw Pachia ryalaw balyn kha ka muih. Zuakute a ccung hae zemah muih lan khyh hae; a haw hae paw nynh ny lan a tuaku hae zemah muih kho khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E uccaw balyn hynh akaw-aleih do mamiate ka tua zah miding hae te mihaw hae tuh mih cyisahnaw balyn ryte Pachia kuih kya nynh a um hae; sungsakunaw tou athua, huakunaw tou athua cipaw ny kho um khyh. Ka malang pawmou a um cipaw a nyh khopaw hum san um khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn kalan phe lokuhpaw uccaw kha yn thua, a dingpaw te a ding leipaw, a hoypaw te a hoy leipaw, a thyaapaw te a thyaa leipaw, silawnaw a raepaw te a rae leipaw tungvaw yn thuapaw uccaw tuh phe lokuh. Ccungccaw hoy hae paw tuh misei hae te lokuh hae zah, bya a kinkuh hae paw tuh bya a kinkuh lei hae paw te phe lokuh hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuanin kaw kya acyihkuhpaw balyn kyaze ahoy leipaw ccangkheit tuh: ccungccaw miakaw nynh uccaw ccangkheit kha ah tung kalang oh. Tuhpiaze, ccungccaw hae thinlung tuh hoyleinaw te phe abeih; mih hiin lungkhu balyn ngaeenaw tuh mih thinlung kya phang a um, tukoute michi hae kalan a cceih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama a hiin hae paw ryte a umkheihpaw miakaw tuh ngaehoinaw a hoi, pawccecize ahiinpaw ui tuh achihpaw chindeih laeze ahoyhua. <verse number="5" style="v" />A hiin hae paw nynh tuh kae chih cih cipaw a nyku hae, thuasalama a chih hae paw nynh tuh pawpaw mah nyh vae khyh hae; mue lanpaw lasung mah hoi vae khyh hae zah, minmin kha ning athua vae hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Mih sungsakunaw, mih huakunaw te mih eiungkunaw hae tuh phe azo vae; khuanin kaw kya acyihkuhpaw balyn hynh papin sekuh bua vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cceih, na looh kha lungtuate ae lah, na misutui kha lungpawte neih; pawccecize Pachia nynh na cyipaw kha a naw phe ccaw vae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na boeining tuh rawpaping lan zungzae um sah; na lu kya thuhkupaw atui kha rousah nan. <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuanin kaw kya Pachia nynh ae pyapaw, accakaepaw na hiinnaw ccyh balyn kha na sungsahpaw na zu ryte lungpawte mang oh, pawccecize tuh-e tuh khuanin kaw na hiin lungkhu na hanpaw thua zah, thawte rya na law mee nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Na law lanpaw ryalaw miakaw kha na thawzung balyn te lawtua; pawccecize na cceih cihnaw Sheol kya tuh ryalaw, tuanaw, nynaw te hawnaw um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuanin kaw kya bua ka muihpaw tuh: ccuetaekunaw kya arang huapaw nynh tae zungzae khyh, rhawtukkunaw kya a thawsae huapaw nynh tae zungzae khyh, ahawpaw ccungccaw nynh looh hoi zungzae khyh, hawnaw a hoipaw nynh mihoipaw lang tang zungzae khyh, cyithyanaw a hoi huapaw nynh maehoynaw mue zungzae khyh; accyh te ccyhhoypaw tuh ccungccaw balyn hanlan a um cipaw ka muih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah ro ccyh kha nyhty khyh. Mia kya a kaepaw ngasaw hawte thuasah, kaang a kaepaw pavaw hawte thuasah ccungccaw hae kha shethya nynh vaekheitmawte he a thuanua hae tuh, shethya kaang a kae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ngaeenaw laeze Hawnaw Ahanghua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuanin kaw kya hynh-e hawnaw kong tousenaw hynh mah ka muih, hynh-e hynh ka hanlan myarya abyapipaw nynh thua cite ka tua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Khua khuakheit la um zah, tuin kya ccungccaw beihtaraw la um hae. Alesaepaw siapharan lu kheit nynh tuh-e khua tuh thiing lan la ccianua zah a la koihlu, thungkhawkunawpaw kha a la raenua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuh-e khua kyatuin a ryachipaw mihawpaw lu kheit la um zah, tuh-e paw nynh a hawnaw liate khua kha a la khum. Tuhzemah tuh-e ryachipaw tuh lu kheit nynh sanmah nyh khyh hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, “Hawnaw hynh thawzung laeze ahoyhua; tuhzemah ryachipaw hawnaw kha theihrya hae zah, a bya kha pawlangria khyh hae,” cite ka ho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Uktu nynh mingaee hae laku</para>
  <para style="q2">thawte a siapaw laeze</para>
  <para style="q1">a hawpaw nynh zyazyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopaw bya ngae tuh ahoyhua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hawnaw tuh rhawtuknawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zunghe laeze ahoyhua,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama misei lu kheit nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hoynaw patae kha a ro.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Achihpaw myn hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">zimuin a raetu kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">mynkhuhpaw kha a thuhsah;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhawte adihpaw ngaeenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnaw te sawtuanaw laeze arihua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahawpaw ccungccaw thinlung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw a ranglang kuih kyakhe a um,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama a ngaeepaw thinlung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw a voilang kuih kya nynh a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mingaee tuh laanpi</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccia lyakhe heize tuanaw hoi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">mingaee athuanawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw miakaw kya a langsaku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Uktu bawi nynh na tungvaw a thinria ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ryalaw kha poutaw nan,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize daebabi lan zya um liate</para>
  <para style="q2">cyiseinaw alepaw kha ngaethya kho athua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuanin kaw ka muihpaw hoyleinaw ccangkheit a um, tuh-e tuh uktu bawi cyiseinaw liate yn poupaw nynh thua: <verse number="6" style="v" />mingaee hae tuh ahangnaw hmin kya um hae zah, mihoi hae tuh anenaw hmin kya a haung hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />See hae nynh marang ccikuh hae zah, bawi hae nynh see hae hawte mih ccu te a ccia hae paw kha ka muih vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hunghua a karouhpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e hunghua lungkhu lang a ccah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">koihpaw lungrua a khyhpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hupaw nynh a tuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 7:15">Sam 7.15</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 26:27">Ptb 26.27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lung a khyhpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e lung keiccuze vaemaw a mue cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thingtung a buapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e thingtung keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">vaemaw a mue cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hae tuh he angoih te</para>
  <para style="q2">taaw leite um lanze,</para>
  <para style="q1">thawzung patae thua aho;</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnaw nynh ccungccaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laansui-uanaw a pya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hupaw nynh oun tuh mawkhe</para>
  <para style="q2">hupaw kha naawty khyh zetuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">hupaw naawthyatu tuh thane vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihawpaw bya nynh amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maehoynaw a muesah,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama mingaee munglae nynh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha a ro.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mih byaho tuh ngaeenaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">tho zah ahoy leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeenaw khate athang.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mingaee tuh apaekuh lei lan</para>
  <para style="q2">bya a ho.</para>
  <para style="q1">Yn cyihkuh cih paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh san nyh khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">malang pawte yn cyiku lanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou a ho kho?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mingaee ryalaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw toulou kha myarya a bangsah,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize khua lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceihpaw laanpi sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">nyh vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ram uktu siapharan tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zawthaw taraw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ram kya-e bawi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">awkhua takaw khe poi a tua hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e ram tuh ngaethya lan</para>
  <para style="q2">umpaw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ram uktu siapharan tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a sung-epaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ram kya-e bawi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zu-aenaw hanlan thua leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">thawzung hanlan cite</para>
  <para style="q2">angaekuhpaw ccyh kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">poi a tua hae, tuh-e ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">alungtuapaw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thawnawnaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">inn lungkhu acia,</para>
  <para style="q2">sawphahkunaw keiccuze inn azu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nuin khylan poi a tua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">misutui nynh lungtuasah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">phua nynh rypaw miakaw a cyi kho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Siapharan kha na thinlung te</para>
  <para style="q2">heize thyalaw nan,</para>
  <para style="q1">mihoipaw kha na ikhung kya</para>
  <para style="q2">heize thyalaw nan;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize azouthyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">pavaw nynh tuh-e roi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a zoukhae cih, tuhkhyhze sake saepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ahysuepaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e kong tuh a ho cih.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zuakunaw Mee</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na looh kha tui vawlan vuatua,</para>
  <para style="q2">nin patae aro te na muethui cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na hoirumnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">san sari khyhze san tarya lang</para>
  <para style="q1">phiate nung, pawccecize</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan pawcihawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ronaw mou yn cyihkuh cih</para>
  <para style="q2">cipaw na nyh khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Maeking tuh khuaatui te he abeih te,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan khuaa arah;</para>
  <para style="q1">thingku tuh alia lang a pu zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">palung lang a pu zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">a punaw hmin kyakhe a huekuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khivae a ngawpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccacii tukuh boi lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">maeking a ngaehoipaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">loohruekuh boi lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hy nynh ccaawpoipaw nopi vue kya a umpaw ru hae kalan pawtemou a thua cipaw na ny khyh hawte, atyn-are a raetupaw Pachia ryalaw kha na nyh khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Awkhua ccyh kya ccacii tu lah, zete ccyh kya mah haeungtaw nan; pawccecize teihynhmou yn hoy cih, e hynh tou, khuh-e khuh tou, tuhkhyhze parouh mawte tou yn hoy cih cipaw na nyh khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Awnaw tuh ahoy, khuanin muih tuh lungrythuakhaeku lan a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih hiinshe asae hae paw tuh mih lung atua cih; tuhzemah mohnaw ccyh patae yn um cih cipaw nyh hae sah. Yn cyihkuh cih paw balyn tuh accakaepaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pou mino, na no lyakhe lungtuate umtua, na no ccyh lyakhe na thinlung tuh lungpawte um sah. Na thinlung nynh a rypaw te na mit nynh a rypaw kha cyitua, thuasalama hynh-e hae balyn keiccuze Pachia nynh bya ae pia cih cipaw nyku tua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na thinlung kyate lungriathaenaw kha vuatua, na pyn kyate ccinaw kha vuatua; pawccecize na zawthaw ccyh tuh sosohte athang cih.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vawsaw ccyh yn thua maw, te “Lungtuanaw ka hoi khyh,” na ci ccyh athua maw, na zawthaw lyakhe nang ae Raetu kha nytua; <verse number="2" style="v" />khuanin te awnaw, sawpaw te awsi hae tuh moh hae zah, maeking tuh khuaatui ryte azo mawkhe amaw kha nytua; <verse number="3" style="v" />tuin nin khe inn ngawtu hae tuh a thyngkuh cih hae zah, mih thawsae hae paw tuh mih thawzya cih, sungsuhpaw nopi hae tuh a zya hae keiccuze ryalaw a haeungtaw cih hae zah, thanlan-aw kyate a do hae paw tuh vyvyte a muih cih hae; <verse number="4" style="v" />laanpi pe e thuakaw kha he a khaw hae te, sungsuhnaw hae paw roi tuh zyazyate nynh accae vae cih, te pavaw roi he accae te, a tho cih zah hlawsah hae paw nopi hae roi tuh zyazyate nynh accae vae cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahangpaw raw kha a rih cih hae zah, laanpi kya myarya rinaw a um cih; almon ku tuh apaw cih, tungkhipaw tuh rutatu lan a vaw cih, a lungry hawte thua vae khyh; pawccecize ccungccaw balyn tuh zungzae mih inn langkhe a cceih hahe cih hae zah, rawkhuite a um hae paw tuh laanpi kya a cceih bungthung cih hae; <verse number="6" style="v" />ngun rui tuh apae cih zah, sui pakekhupaw tuh akoi cih, tuidy kya tuipung akoi cih, tuisung kya-e thenawpaw arui apae cih, <verse number="7" style="v" />laenoi tuh yn thuanaw laephi kalan a ki cih zah, hy tuh a pyatu Pachia kalan a ki cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Accakaepaw, atyn-are hynh accakaepaw nynh thua cite Phunghotu nynh a ho.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thangsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phunghotu tuh a haw keiccuze a nypaw kha ccungccaw hae kya a ccangpya hae, phungtangbya kha akaw-aleih ccangkute a ccaesah. <verse number="10" style="v" />Phunghotu nynh lungrythua lan umpaw bya hae kha ccung zah, byaccing athuapaw bya kha ccaerarih lan a zei.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A haw hae paw bya tuh ahepaw ccungngue te nynh aloku, a suelua hae paw bya hae tuh tynkaring lan khiadepaw thingkhia hawte thua zah, aening balyn oun do-oihtu tuurinpaw nynh a pya hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ccapaw, hynh-e hae koute na raeringku lanpaw a um ung. Ccauh patae rae hynh thangthya khyh, thawte ccaw ccangku hynh mah pynsaw abangkuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />E bya hae balyn athang te, ho lanpaw ccangkheit a um ung. Pachia kha rih lah, a kawbya hae kha zuitua; pawccecize Pachia nynh ccungccaw a raenuathepaw tuh hynh-e hanlan nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuruhpaw uccaw miakaw, ahoypaw thuasah, athahpaw thuasah, cyisahnaw miakaw kha Pachia nynh bya a pia cih.</para>
</usx>